Package: gifter
Type: Package
Title: Genome-Inferred Functional Traits from Genomic Evidence
Version: 0.7.1
Authors@R: person("Antton", "Alberdi", email = "antton.alberdi@sund.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Infers whether a genome encodes biologically defined metabolic,
    structural, regulatory, and defense capabilities. Each claim is evaluated
    through an explicit, curated completeness model stored in a versioned
    SQLite reference database. The package reports complete and closest
    incomplete implementations together with auditable genomic evidence; it
    does not infer activity, phenotype, or environmental relevance.
